{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PVP FIGHTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in exciting ranked fights against other players. Improve your skills, level up your Heroes, and move up the Leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/2afc309def2725e128b435ea780e2759.poster.avif?t=1768553188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/2afc309def2725e128b435ea780e2759.webm?t=1768553188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXTRAORDINARY HEROES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter both old friends from the Shadow Fight universe and brand new characters. A charismatic demon, an experienced samurai, a queen of the criminal world, or a shadow bot \u2014 every player will find their favorite among dozens of unique Heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/0aa60ed16e2b9afd8761cf466f598776.poster.avif?t=1768553188\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/0aa60ed16e2b9afd8761cf466f598776.webm?t=1768553188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VARIETY OF COMBAT STYLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Hero has their own style and abilities. As you level up, you unlock special talents for your Heroes, allowing you to actively experiment with tactics and strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/896a2ac7a8e669f85a3b36c9e9104406.poster.avif?t=1768553188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/896a2ac7a8e669f85a3b36c9e9104406.webm?t=1768553188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stories is a PvE mode that provides a great opportunity to dive deeper into the world of Shadow Fight. You can learn more about your favorite Heroes in a rogue-like style. It's also a great way to take a break after intense ranked battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/b0f851cea18e4c96fd75b4a9b9545c9c.poster.avif?t=1768553188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/b0f851cea18e4c96fd75b4a9b9545c9c.webm?t=1768553188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DUELS WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can always challenge a friend to an online duel. It's a great way to practice or find out who's the best!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>APPEARANCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skins for Heroes, weapons, fighting stances, taunts, victory poses, and even phrase packs. You will stand out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>..AND MUCH MORE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special events, themed tournaments, motivational marathons, fun temporary modes \u2014 there will be no time for boredom. Join Shadow Fight Arena and Keep fighting! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1446890?t=1768553188","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/347c25874d5532efea973efdd6e2cff4026555c9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768553188","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/406ef02fbd176d121385b666086981cc32c9533c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768553188","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/406ef02fbd176d121385b666086981cc32c9533c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768553188","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PVP FIGHTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in exciting ranked fights against other players. Improve your skills, level up your Heroes, and move up the Leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/2afc309def2725e128b435ea780e2759.poster.avif?t=1768553188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/2afc309def2725e128b435ea780e2759.webm?t=1768553188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXTRAORDINARY HEROES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter both old friends from the Shadow Fight universe and brand new characters. A charismatic demon, an experienced samurai, a queen of the criminal world, or a shadow bot \u2014 every player will find their favorite among dozens of unique Heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/0aa60ed16e2b9afd8761cf466f598776.poster.avif?t=1768553188\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/0aa60ed16e2b9afd8761cf466f598776.webm?t=1768553188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VARIETY OF COMBAT STYLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Hero has their own style and abilities. As you level up, you unlock special talents for your Heroes, allowing you to actively experiment with tactics and strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/896a2ac7a8e669f85a3b36c9e9104406.poster.avif?t=1768553188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/896a2ac7a8e669f85a3b36c9e9104406.webm?t=1768553188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stories is a PvE mode that provides a great opportunity to dive deeper into the world of Shadow Fight. You can learn more about your favorite Heroes in a rogue-like style. It's also a great way to take a break after intense ranked battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/b0f851cea18e4c96fd75b4a9b9545c9c.poster.avif?t=1768553188\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/b0f851cea18e4c96fd75b4a9b9545c9c.webm?t=1768553188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DUELS WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can always challenge a friend to an online duel. It's a great way to practice or find out who's the best!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>APPEARANCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skins for Heroes, weapons, fighting stances, taunts, victory poses, and even phrase packs. You will stand out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>..AND MUCH MORE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special events, themed tournaments, motivational marathons, fun temporary modes \u2014 there will be no time for boredom. Join Shadow Fight Arena and Keep fighting! </p>","developers":["Nekki Limited"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/448d89171179e1374d08532eed687b117ecc6e61/header.jpg?t=1768553188","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2018-2025, Nekki Limited. All rights reserved. Shadow Fight Arena and its logo are Nekki trademarks or registered trademarks in the EU and elsewhere.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nProduct of Nekki.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1446890/1719608488/ec07b314fbb1ca69eae36353d4d4c5f8781bca45/1758821215/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759237491","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1446890/1719608488/ec07b314fbb1ca69eae36353d4d4c5f8781bca45/1758821215/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759237491","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1446890/1719608488/ec07b314fbb1ca69