 Shadow Tournament. Choose your Hero and prove what you are capable of!","steam_appid":1446890,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://nekki.helpshift.com/hc/15-shadow-fight-4-arena"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Vietnamese, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Japanese, Indonesian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://shadowfight.com/"}